{"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/ManualIntegration"},"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Manual Integration"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Download the SDK","anchor":"Download-the-SDK","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework","│   ├── CardSessions.xcframework","│   ├── Card.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"text"},{"anchor":"Required-Frameworks","text":"Required Frameworks","type":"heading","level":2},{"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Sessions-Approach","text":"Network Token Provisioning (Sessions Approach)","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following framework is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"required","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for the sessions-based provisioning:"}]},{"